se randomly output one of \"[[A]]\", \"[[B]]\", \"[[C]]\", or \"[[D]]\";\n(3) Please only output the most likely answer index based on the given information, and do not output any other content.\n\n[Story]\nOn a sunny afternoon, the adults in the community start to clean the streets. At this time, Aunt Mei walks into the security booth of the community and finds Xiao Wei, who is playing with keys in his hand. Aunt Mei smiles gently, hands him a small bag, pats Xiao Wei's shoulder, and glances in the direction of Da Hu throwing trash, then turns and leaves. Da Hu finds the bag in Xiao Wei's hand next to the trash can, he seems to be puzzled by the bag in Xiao Wei's hand.\n\n[Question]\nWhy does Aunt Mei give Xiao Wei a bag?\n\n[Candidate Answers]\nA. Aunt Mei gives her personal belongings to Xiao Wei for safekeeping.\nB. Aunt Mei hopes Xiao Wei can tactfully remind Da Hu not to litter.\nC. Aunt Mei gives Xiao Wei some trash to help throw away.\nD. Aunt Mei gives Xiao Wei the gift in the bag, hoping he is happy.","options":null,"imageContent":null,"audioContent":null,"videoContent":null,"reminderContext":null,"videoCoverUrl":null,"chips":null,"customMessage":null,"media":null,"mediaTime":null,"interceptContent":null,"contents":[],"imgs":null,"regenerations":0,"seqNum":2,"responseSource":"agent:llm","isSuicide":false,"isSuicideConf":7.096553442764859E-4,"emotions":[],"relationId":"6af3e1d7d6006945d2800a42","courseProgressId":0,"tsGen":1794367959627,"createTime":"2026-11-11 11:32:39","delFlag":0,"emotionTendency":null,"sourceProductType":null,"sourceProductId":null,"consultantBotId":null,"consultantUserId":null}],"first":true,"last":true},"nonce":"d0812b564da440dc86ab0af97269a04b"}